<title>UK: No FTSE-100 stocks trade ex-dividend on Dec 23.</title>
<headline>No FTSE-100 stocks trade ex-dividend on Dec 23.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>There were no FTSE 100 stocks that traded ex-dividend on Monday December 23, FTSE International said.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4027</p>
